---
args: {"clock": "ObligationClock", "deliveries": "DeliveryClaim[]", "sources": "EvidencePage[]"}
returns: "AcceptanceDecision"
---
Distinguish receipt acknowledgment, approval for review, conditional acceptance, partial phase acceptance and rejection. Quote or cite the operative response and its exact scope. An acceptance of phase one leaves other phases open. Preserve the actual respondent and supported event time; do not infer acceptance from silence unless the separate configured deemed-acceptance test succeeds.
